{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Side-scrolling Card Magic Tower\uff0ca roguelike &quot;Magic Tower&quot; single-player game that blends &quot;platform jumping&quot; and &quot;card battles&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your route and encounter enemies through platform jumping, then defeat them with strategic card duels! Explore hundreds of cards and countless combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the unique &quot;Block Energy&quot; system! It replaces traditional card costs, challenging you to Tetris your cards together within a limited space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homage to the Classics: The framework of &quot;Magic Tower&quot; \u00d7 The cards of &quot;Slay the Spire&quot; \u00d7 The platforming of &quot;Celeste&quot; \u00d7 The chain strategy of &quot;Tetris&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258e<strong>Side-view jumping. Find the optimal path.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform Jump: Choose to Encounter Monsters and Plan Your Battle Path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras/0af70330f91a39292ed491d60ba8c137.avif?t=1769971626\" alt=\"Platform Jump: Choose to encounter monsters and plan your battle route\" width=1560 height=994 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258e<strong>Card Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cards and fight monsters as strong as you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras/02ec8c66d1f814442c116d0c796a1ead.avif?t=1769971626\" alt=\"Card Battle. Build cards and fight monsters as strong as you.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras_big/02ec8c66d1f814442c116d0c796a1ead.avif?t=1769971626 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards lack energy and are replaced by block space. (Similar to Tetris)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras/00d562751fffcf7761d83a7b5eeec47c.avif?t=1769971626\" alt=\"Block playing area\" width=1334 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras/e8a897c9cda515f0b02d4449a9265029.avif?t=1769971626\" alt=\"A card\" width=250 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, there will be more interesting combinations, no longer just boring amounts of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258e<strong>Interesting props full of wit and humor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find more props to help you overcome obstacles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras/e12fb4f66c0c04f1aac6c07e65db28d8.avif?t=1769971626\" alt=\"Interesting props full of wit and humor\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/extras_big/e12fb4f66c0c04f1aac6c07e65db28d8.avif?t=1769971626 width=1560 height=846 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are YOU Ready? Launching Soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104040?t=1769971626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104040/20d578cc74693860ce225affd70cbf787162d21c/page_bg_raw.j